        "accession_number": "0001107843-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer our PCP as a subscription-based platform services to the customer using a virtual version of our software.",
        "start_character": 8935,
        "end_character": 9055
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001107843-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001107843-26-000008-19ce4e5d7f241987",
        "accession_number": "0001107843-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We market and sell our solutions to enterprises, government entities and small and medium-sized businesses across a broad range of industries, including education, financial services, government, healthcare, insurance, manufacturing, media, retail, technology and utilities.",
        "start_character": 27785,
        "end_character": 28059
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001107843-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001107843-26-000008-19ce4e5d7f241987",
        "accession_number": "0001107843-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer free trials and services to allow prospective customers to experience the quality of our solutions, to learn in detail about the features and functionality of our cloud platform, and to quantify the potential benefits of our solutions.",
        "start_character": 31585,
        "end_character": 31829
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001107843-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001107843-26-000008-19ce4e5d7f241987",
        "accession_number": "0001107843-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide our solutions through a software-as-a-service model, primarily with renewable annual subscriptions.",
        "start_character": 5944,
        "end_character": 6054
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001107843-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001107843-26-000008-19ce4e5d7f241987",
        "accession_number": "0001107843-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we had 2,625 full-time employees, including 1,262 in research and development, 524 in sales and marketing, 592 in operations and customer support, and 247 in general and administrative.",
        "start_character": 38783,
        "end_character": 38993
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001107843-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001107843-26-000008-19ce4e5d7f241987",
        "accession_number": "0001107843-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As we continue to extend our cloud platform’s functionality by further developing IT, security and compliance solutions, such as Cybersecurity Asset Management, Patch Management, and Enterprise TruRisk Management, we expect to face additional competition in these new markets.",
        "start_character": 35552,
        "end_character": 35828
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001107843-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001107843-26-000008-19ce4e5d7f241987",
        "accession_number": "0001107843-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition to our development teams, we also built a sophisticated research team focused on identifying threats and developing signatures for vulnerabilities and compliance checks so that we can provide our customers with daily updates and enable them to scan their assets for the latest threats.",
        "start_character": 33032,
        "end_character": 33329
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001107843-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001107843-26-000008-19ce4e5d7f241987",
        "accession_number": "0001107843-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In this regard, we continue to enhance our sales execution and marketing functions to increase adoption of our newly developed solutions among our existing customers.",
        "start_character": 25927,
        "end_character": 26093
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001107843-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001107843-26-000008-19ce4e5d7f241987",
        "accession_number": "0001107843-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also provide open application program interfaces, or APIs, and other developer tools that allow third parties to embed our technology into their solutions and build applications on our platform.",
